source dir: /tmp/mutF/M21_no_checkpoint_on_suspension  solc 0.8.37+commit.f401782d.Emscripten.clang

=== F — FoundationDAO ===
✅ F0) 15 genesis members seeded; membershipNonce = 0
✅ F1) genesis member can vote on P (memberSinceNonce 0 <= createdAtNonce 0)
✅ F2) X added after P was created cannot vote on P
✅ F3) X can vote on a proposal created after its admission
✅ F4) removed member's earlier vote on P is still counted
✅ F5) removed member cannot vote again (onlyMember)
✅ F6) P still Pending and quorum unchanged after add+remove (not invalidated)
✅ F7) re-added member cannot vote on Q (created before re-admission, never voted by it)
✅ F8) re-added member can vote on a proposal created after re-admission
✅ F9) double vote rejected
✅ F10.create-then-add) same block: Y is member=true; Y may NOT vote on SB
✅ F10.add-then-create) same block: Y is member=true; Y MAY vote on SB

=== R — ValidatorsRegistry ===
✅ R0) 7 founders seeded; statusNonce = 0; invariant isValidator ⇔ getValidators holds at genesis
✅ R1) no history -> wasActiveAt(outsider, any) = false
✅ R2) founder seeded checkpoint {0,true}: wasActiveAt(founder, 0) = true
✅ R3) quorum frozen by the existing formula (active/2 + 1 = 4) and createdAtNonce recorded
❌ R4) exact nonce boundary: wasActiveAt(V1, n-1 of its change) true, at its change false → false
✅ R5) invariant holds after two suspensions
✅ R6) suspended voter cannot vote while suspended
✅ R7) invariant holds after recovery
✅ R8) eligible-at-creation voter, suspended then recovered, may vote (P1)
❌ R9) suspended AT creation (P2), recovered later -> not eligible → did NOT revert
✅ R10) voter who voted before suspension cannot vote again after recovery
✅ R11) suspension did not delete the recorded vote (P1 votes = 3: V0, V1, V2)
✅ R12) invariant holds after a new activation
✅ R13) validator activated after P1 cannot vote on P1
✅ R14) ...but can vote on a proposal created after its activation
✅ R15) exited voter's vote stays counted
✅ R16) exited validator cannot vote
✅ R17) invariant holds after exit
✅ R18) exited address cannot re-register  true
❌ R19) consecutive transitions: V5 history is 1→0→1→0→1 across nonces (4 boundaries) → false  seq=1111111
✅ R20.create-then-activate) same block: C may NOT vote
✅ R20.activate-then-create) same block: C MAY vote

=== T/D — ValidatorsTreasury and BlockRewardDistributor (validator chamber) ===
✅ T1) Treasury: validator activated after creation cannot vote
✅ D1) Distributor validator chamber: activated after creation cannot vote
✅ T2) Treasury: suspended voter blocked while suspended
✅ T3) Treasury: eligible-at-creation voter recovered -> may vote once
✅ D2) Distributor: eligible-at-creation voter (suspended+recovered) may vote once
✅ T4) Treasury quorum still the existing formula (6 active at creation -> 4)
✅ D3) Distributor quorum still the existing formula (ceil(2/3·6) = 4)

